# Keep LF line endings in the working tree on every OS. Git for Windows
# defaults to core.autocrlf=true, which would turn Go sources, the help
# golden file, the fuzz corpus and README into CRLF and break gofmt and
# the byte-exact tests.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Batch files keep CRLF: cmd.exe misreads labels in LF-only scripts.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
